  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们来讨论在闭区间 $[-\\pi,\\pi]$ 上函数 $y=\\sin x$ 的图象（图24）. 按照一般的讨论步骤，求出导函数：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 36,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0042#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\sin'x=\\cos x$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 36,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0042#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "求驻点. 因为在闭区间 $[-\\pi,\\pi]$ 上，仅当 $x=-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ 和 $x$ $=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$时，$\\cos x=0$，所以这两点就是驻点. 函数的上升和下降表示在下面的表里.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 36,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0042#11",
        "p0043#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "tbl-p0043-01",
      "label": "表",
      "printed_page": 37,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0043#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为正弦函数具有周期$2\\pi$，在平移$\\vec{T}(2\\pi,0)$的情况下，它的图象变成它自身. 于是，在$[-\\pi+2\\pi n,\\pi+2\\pi n]$里，$\\sin$函数的图象可以由图24画出的图象通过平移$\\vec{T}(2\\pi n,0)$，$n\\in Z$得出（图25）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 37,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0043#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-24",
      "label": "图 24",
      "printed_page": 37,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0043#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 24",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 24",
      "printed_page": 37,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0043#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-25",
      "label": "图 25",
      "printed_page": 37,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0043#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 25",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 25",
      "printed_page": 37,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0043#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "正弦函数在闭区间$\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$上是上升的，而且由于连续性，它取闭区间$[-1,1]$里所有的值. 因此函数$y=\\sin x$在闭区间$\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$上是可逆函数，就是说，它有反函数，叫做反正弦，记作$\\arcsin$. 函数$y=\\arcsin x$的图象表示在图26中.这个图象和函数$y=\\sin x\\left(x\\in\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]\\right)$的图象关于直线$y=x$是对称的. 由反函数的定义得出，$D(\\arcsin)=[-1,1]$，$E(\\arcsin)=\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$，于是，反正弦是奇函数并且是增函数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 37,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0043#8",
        "p0044#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们来计算几个反正弦的值.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0044#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\arcsin\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$，因为　　$\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{4}=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$，而且　　$\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\in\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$；",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0044#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-26",
      "label": "图 26",
      "printed_page": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0044#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 26",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 26",
      "printed_page": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0044#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\arcsin\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)=-\\frac{\\pi}{6}$，因为$\\sin\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}$，而且　　$-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\in\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$；",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0044#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\arcsin1=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$，因为$\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{2}=1$，而且　　$\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\in\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$；",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0044#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\arcsin(-1)=-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$，因为$\\sin\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right)=-1$，而且　　$-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\in\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 38,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0044#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "求带有两位小数的$\\arcsin$函数值，利用数值自变量的$\\sin$函数表最简单. 为了计算带有四位小数的$\\arcsin$函数值，要利用两个表：用度表示的角度的正弦表和把角度的度数换算成弧度的表. 这时利用了这样一个事实：即数$y$的正弦等于$y$弧度角的正弦.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为了求出$\\arcsin x$，在$-90^\\circ\\leqslant\\alpha^\\circ\\leqslant90^\\circ$范围内求出角度$\\alpha^\\circ$，使得",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\sin\\alpha^\\circ=x$；",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把$\\alpha^\\circ$表示成弧度：　　$\\alpha^\\circ=y$弧度，得到",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\sin y=x$，$\\arcsin x=y$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 1 求$\\arcsin0.9063$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$0.9063\\approx\\sin65^\\circ$，$65^\\circ\\approx1.1345$弧度，$\\arcsin0.9063\\approx1.1345$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在说明怎样借助引入的反正弦函数解",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\sin x=a$　　　　　　　　　(1)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这种形式的最简单的方程.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为$-1\\leqslant\\sin x\\leqslant1$，那么当$a>1$和$a<-1$时，方程(1)无解（图27）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "当$a=1$时，方程(1)具有$\\sin x=1$的形式，得到解",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2k\\pi$，$k\\in Z$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 39,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0045#13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-27",
      "label": "图 27",
      "printed_page": 40,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0046#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 27",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 27",
      "printed_page": 40,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0046#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-28",
      "label": "图 28",
      "printed_page": 40,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0046#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 28",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 28",
      "printed_page": 40,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0046#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "当$a=-1$时，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 40,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0046#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=-\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2k\\pi$，$k\\in Z$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 40,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0046#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为了求出当$|a|<1$时方程(1)所有的解，只要在长度为$2\\pi$的任一区间上，求出这个方程所有的解就行了，因为正弦的周期等于$2\\pi$. 由图28可以看出，取闭区间$\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{3}{2}\\pi\\right]$比较方便. 实际上，在闭区间$\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$上，正弦是上升的，并且取它的每一个值一次. 而在闭区间$\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{3}{2}\\pi\\right]$上，正弦是下降的，并且也取它的每一个值一次. 于是，在这两个闭区间的每一闭区间上，方程(1)有一个解. 根据反正弦的定义，在闭区间$\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$上方程(1)的解是$\\arcsin a$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 40,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0046#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "为了求出在闭区间$\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{3}{2}\\pi\\right]$上方程(1)的解，利用公式$\\sin x=\\sin(\\pi-x)$.如果$x\\in\\left[\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{3}{2}\\pi\\right]$，那么$\\pi-x\\in\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$（说明为什么）.方程$\\sin x=a$和方程$\\sin(\\pi-x)=a$同解. 又因为$\\pi-x\\in\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$，那么$\\pi-x=\\arcsin a$，就是说，$x=\\pi-\\arcsin a$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0047#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在，为了写出方程(1)所有的解，必须利用正弦的周期性，就是把所得两个解中的每一个解加上数$2\\pi m$，$m\\in Z$. 得到的解集合是由两个无穷子集构成的：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0047#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=\\arcsin a+\\pi2m$，　　　　　　　　　(2)$x=-\\arcsin a+\\pi(2m+1)$.　　　　　　　(3)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0047#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们看出，可以把式(2)和(3)合并成一个式子：",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0047#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$x=(-1)^k\\arcsin a+\\pi k$，$k\\in Z$.　　　(4)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0047#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "实际上，当$k$是偶数时，由(4)式得到(2)式；当$k$是奇数时，由(4)式得到(3)式（把$k=2m$和$k=2m+1$代入(4)式进行检验）.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0047#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "注　当$a=1$和$a=-1$时，由式(2)和(3)确定的解集合相同.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 41,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0047#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 2 解方程$\\sin x=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 42,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0048#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "根据(4)式得：$x=(-1)^k\\arcsin\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}+\\pi k$，$k\\in Z$，因为$\\arcsin\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$（参看上面），那么$x=(-1)^k\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi k$，$k\\in Z$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 42,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0048#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 3 解方程$\\sin x=1$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 42,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0048#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "根据(4)式得：$x=(-1)^k\\arcsin1+\\pi k$；因为$\\arcsin1=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$（参看上面），那么$x=(-1)^k\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\pi k$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 42,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0048#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "当$k=2m$是偶数时，得到：$x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2m\\pi$. 当$k=2m+1$是奇数时，得到：$x=-\\frac{\\pi}{2}+(2m+1)\\pi=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2m\\pi$. 由此看出，当$a=1$时，解的写法可简化成：$x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2m\\pi$，$m\\in Z$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 42,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0048#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 4 解方程$\\sin x=0$.根据(4)式得：$x=(-1)^k\\arcsin0+\\pi k$.因为$\\sin0=0$，$0\\in\\left[-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$，所以$\\arcsin0=0$，因此　　　　　　$x=\\pi k$，$k\\in Z$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 42,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0048#6",
        "p0049#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 5 解方程$\\sin x=0.932$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 43,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0049#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "根据(4)式得：$x=(-1)^k\\arcsin0.932+\\pi k$，$k\\in Z$，其中$\\arcsin0.932\\approx1.2$.反正弦的近似值根据伯拉基斯编的《数学用表》求出.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 43,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0049#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在列出正弦函数的基本性质.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 43,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0049#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "1. 函数的定义域是整个数轴：$D(\\sin)=R$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 43,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0049#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2. 正弦值的集合是闭区间$[-1,1]$：$E(\\sin)=[-1,1]$，就是说，正弦是有界函数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 43,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0049#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "3. 正弦是奇函数：对于所有的$x\\in R$，$\\sin(-x)=-\\sin x$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 43,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0049#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "4. 正弦是具有最小正周期$2\\pi$的周期函数：对于所有的$x\\in R$，$\\sin(x+2\\pi)=\\sin x$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 43,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0049#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "5. 对于所有的$x=\\pi n$，其中$n\\in Z$，$\\sin x=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 43,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0049#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "6. 对于所有的$x\\in]2\\pi n;\\pi+2\\pi n[(x\\in Z)$，$\\sin x>0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 43,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0049#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "7. 对于所有的$x\\in]\\pi+2\\pi n;2\\pi+2\\pi n[(n\\in Z)$，$\\sin x<0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 43,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0049#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "8. 正弦函数是连续的，并且在数轴的每一点都有导数.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 43,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0049#12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
